  "body": "Panda's unified compiled-table and runtime extension paths, private GLX/POSIX fallback, and early legacy context creation were outside the previous delivery table's proven coverage. This adds opt-in hooks at the four exact pinned source files and builds a separate minimal GL/X11/noPython SDK. The default path preserves original calls, arguments, return/NULL and errno; the read tail forwards only to the original function and has no capture arming API.\n\n- Pinned upstream470e352ab87ceae6e30429720e4690c8371f5a55; reconstructed full tree6081b4b6fae45013d48930264bc15532f165422f.35direct calls,2common extension returns,3GLXpaths and1POSIXpath transformed.\n- Exact-source stager and constrained builder preserve prior inputs/failed output.12private Debian packages, no global install. Necessary CPU build-time generators execute; candidate Panda/GL libraries are inspected only as data.\n- Actual build first failed on upstream's prebuilt Bison fallback; private generators fixed the build path. Failure, partial output and successful build receipts are retained. Final selected candidate and verification are below.\n- Default-OFF typed wrappers, resolver alias/name snapshots, deletion snapshots, owner/reentry/callback/budget failure and original-only read tail have CPU regression coverage. Source/SDK/ELF/raw logs and indexed evidence are in docs/evidence/panda-source-dispatch-01/.\n\nFinal source HEAD:55ab312dcded2a55640a560441010f8f2737531d (implementation0071da8a47aa7648d95a02b2c93a1df960ce6b1d). Selected actual SDK974432bytes/SHA256228b2d88e91fa9c5ded10cfe8e93f9b9519de881a37765a0e8681af6e36cf96b; fresh compile/link135.320271794s.7281source files/2674SDK output records pinned; original-read bare tail/R_X86_64_64 binding verified; old ABI rejected. The current runner invoked this static checker.\n\nVerification:23focusedPASS9.358s;1464fulltests/1457PASS/7skip140.648s;25normal+25ASan/UBSan CPU scenarios produce identical outcomes,2unsafe configurations reject. One fresh whole-branch review ataf583a8 found0Critical/2Important/1Minor. Both Important findings were reproduced and fixed in one TDDpass: resolver lifetime reentry, and whole-build-process-group cleanup/final disk-size acceptance. Minor automatic numbered resume receipts remain deferred; existing actual prior receipts were manually preserved. All9reviewer-declined behaviors have explicit executor rulings. No rereview/minor polishing.108indexedproofs/11,798,110bytes are Git-tracked;122newfiles,0basefilechanges, clean checkout.\n\nThe final compile receipt and later separate read-binding inspection are distinguished. The old653-import reader scope is relocation types6/7; the R_X86_64_64 original-read pointer is separately validated. No custom runtime constructor is present; upstream Panda still has its own constructors.\n\nExisting3207base files/299old source pins/10originals/main/Drafts102\u2013109/eightnative workflow histories are preserved. No Cloud/registry publication, main/shared-base merge/push, consumed request reuse or new native/GL/provider/model/officialORT run. Native allowance0, inherited strict0/4FAIL, Stage7INCOMPLETE. The SDK lacks full Python/MetaDrive image parity and cannot replace the old image. Bootstrap/deletion cache adapter, actual branch/coverage profile, mapped ABI/camera/lifetime/environment and fresh bounded ON/OFF contract remain future gates.\n\nPlan/spec/result/continuation and exhaustive review rulings: docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-15-panda-source-dispatch.md; docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-15-panda-source-dispatch.md; docs/STAGE7_PANDA_SOURCE_DISPATCH_{RESULT,LEDGER,CONTINUATION}.md. This PR stays Draft and unmerged against feature/panda-dispatch-coverage-v1 at5aefbd5ca54557de79d00c67282c086e8a6bca61.\n\nExact final-source CI verified for55ab312dcded2a55640a560441010f8f2737531d, workflow411705464:\n- pull_request run[43664486681](https://github.com/rownlvh8875-coder/big-model-closed-loop-benchmark/actions/runs/43664486681),attempt1,SUCCESS,artifacts0; jobs onnx-interface-test=132660737006, synthetic-unit=132660737269.\n- push run[43664483715](https://github.com/rownlvh8875-coder/big-model-closed-loop-benchmark/actions/runs/43664483715),attempt1,SUCCESS,artifacts0; jobs synthetic-unit=132660727429, onnx-interface-test=132660727630.\n\nFinal preservation at2026-11-15T10:46:46.556265+09:00:3207basefiles/299oldsourcepins/10originals/main/Drafts102\u2013109/eightnativehistories unchanged. No new native runs; allowance0. The ONNX interface job uses a generated SMALL TEST GRAPH ONLY, never the official large model. Retained output/stage7-panda-source-dispatch-01/final-verification.json binds exact final HEAD, CI, proof index, actual SDK and preservation. All4jobs succeeded; this Draft stays open/unmerged.\n",
